":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-06-14T09:43:49Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2167681899","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/41200#issuecomment-2167681899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/41200","id":2167681899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM6BNDNr","user":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-14T09:58:05Z","updated_at":"2024-06-14T09:58:05Z","body":"I'm sorry but I have no idea what the MapStruct Quarkus integration looks like. In any case, the `QuarkusComponentTest` does not involve any extensions, which means that no build steps are executed at all. In other words, it works with \"pure\" CDI components only. See also the [Lifecycle](https://quarkus.io/guides/getting-started-testing#lifecycle) chapter in the docs.\r\n\r\n> If you replace @QuarkusComponentTest by @QuarkusTest the test works fine.\r\n\r\nIndeed, `@QuarkusTest` runs the full build of your app.\r\n\r\nWhat's weird that you get a NPE - this should never happen. You should get a reasonable error message instead. Could you pls share a simple reproducer app?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2167681899/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2167693879","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/41200#issuecomment-2167693879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/41200","id":2167693879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM6BNGI3","user":{"login":"octopus-prime","id":7620013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MjAwMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7620013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/octopus-prime","ht